    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      490.64,
      286.44,
      569.84
    ],
    "text": "All that divided and defined allotment of land marked Lot No. 01 in the Preliminary Plan dated 07.09.2016 and in the Preliminary Plan Hambantota No. 69 prepared by Surveyor General called Kachcheri Walawwatta alias Surveyor Antony Mahattaya hitapuwatta containing in extent 0.9210 Hectare is bounded as follows:",
